      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: At the moment anyone who does not have constant admin rights, like someone who has a parent as a buffer for admin, is unable to update as VRC-CC doesn't use the same trick apps like steam use to update.\nAllowing for a portable install (even if it puts permissions in the log for debugging) would let people use the tool without this limitation.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
